cham3-full (0.0.0~m1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * M1 metapackage: cham3-desktop plus the curated application suite.
  * Codex review F2 (owner-approved): adds librewolf (official LibreWolf
    repository) and zaproxy, amass, exploitdb, ghidra and radare2 (Kali archive,
    per-package allowlist) as dependencies. The sources, keys and pins live in
    the image definition (build/live-desktop), not in this package. mitmproxy,
    wpscan and metasploit-framework are deferred pending separate review and are
    not dependencies; cutter and rizin are omitted in favour of radare2 and
    burpsuite in favour of zaproxy (see the package description).
  * Maintainer address is a reserved placeholder pending an owner decision.

